Jer 9:1 , Jeremiah laments the Jews for their manifold sins;
Jer 9:9 , and for their judgment;
Jer 9:12 , Disobedience is the cause of their bitter calamity;
Jer 9:17 , He exhorts to mourn for their destruction;
Jer 9:23 , and to trust not in themselves, but in God;
Jer 9:25 , He threatens both Jews and Gentiles.
